{"type":"system","subtype":"hook_response","hook_id":"56cb5840-ecb0-4808-b1f3-22fdc33ccb16","hook_name":"SessionStart:startup","hook_event":"SessionStart","output":"bin: ~/.local/bin/lavish-axi\ndescription: \"Lavish Editor helps agents turn rich HTML artifacts into collaborative human review surfaces. Whenever you are about to give user a complex response that will be easier to understand via a rich / interactive page, consider using Lavish Editor. First generate an interactive HTML artifact according to user request, then run `lavish-axi <html-file>` so the user can visually review it, annotate elements or selected text, queue prompts, and send feedback back through `lavish-axi poll`.\"\nsessions[52]{file,status,url,pending_prompts,listener}:\n  /private/tmp/afkx-firstmate-decision.html,open,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/aeb80b8b2ba7ca29\",0,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/4151105f/tmp/lavish/linux-server-trial.html,feedback,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/f012095d955dd24c\",0,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/a30d7957/tmp/backpass-upstream-decision.html,open,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/43b2c19414f5cd4f\",0,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/a30d7957/tmp/model-index-decision.html,open,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/2f5bad85c1140b4a\",0,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/a30d7957/tmp/throughput-handicaps-2026-09-30.html,open,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/07837d001b8d634b\",0,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/a30d7957/tmp/workstream-review-2026-09-29.html,open,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/692a10f7b452c8bb\",0,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/a30d7957/tmp/workstream-review-2026-09-30.html,open,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/58109bf1510f501f\",0,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/a5b22ca0/tmp/vernant-tracking-model/path-to-done.html,feedback,\"http://127.0.0.1:4387/session/0570c09a4d08372e\",1,none\n  /Users/charlesabrooker/.claude/jobs/ba4cbfc9/tmp/report-20261004.html,open,\"http://12